## Built container image license

The published container image family
`ghcr.io/patrick-folster/cyclestone-dev-container-base` is a composite artifact whose
effective license differs from the repository source license. Its SPDX
license expression is recorded in the `org.opencontainers.image.licenses` OCI
label and is currently `LicenseRef-Container-Image-Review-Required`.

This custom license reference reflects that the image is a composite of:

- The Ubuntu 24.04 LTS base image, which carries its own upstream licenses
  (see the base distribution's `/usr/share/doc/*/copyright` files inside the
  image).
- The Cyclestone CLI binary, which is MIT-licensed and installed under
  `/home/developer/.local/share/licenses/cyclestone/` inside the image.
- Optional provider CLIs (codex, agy, ollama, opencode) acquired at build
  time from their respective publishers, each under its own upstream license.

Publication of the image is review-gated and signature/provenance-attested;
see [docs/architecture/threat-model.md](./docs/architecture/threat-model.md)
and [docs/architecture/release-reproduction.md](./docs/architecture/release-reproduction.md).

